Description:

A sharee moving an email between someone else's mailboxes over JMAP no
longer needs the right to add items to the mailbox the email is leaving;
removing from it is enough.  When a sharee does lack a needed right, Email/set
now reports forbidden for a compact mailbox id, as it already did for a
legacy one, instead of invalidProperties.


